-- test: `next` in a branch of `first of` is U3033; under the preview's `τ_conc`, which is `⊤` in a branch, it is also U4003 under the race's timing floor (spec/31 §1, ADR 0123 rule 5)
-- spec: spec/31 §1
-- expect: error U3033 at src/srv.una:13:13
-- expect: error U4003 at src/srv.una:13:13
module srv

import std.host (HttpServer, ServeError)

wait() -> Unit
  uses @server: HttpServer[next]
=
  let got = first of
    attempt @server.next()
    Err(Closed)
  unit
